    "name": "King Arthur: Legends Rise",
    "steam_appid": 2279730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/ee4866872c82dc133d7b0b4347ab094a.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/ee4866872c82dc133d7b0b4347ab094a.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/ee4866872c82dc133d7b0b4347ab094a.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the battle for the fate of Europe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fires of war have spread across Camelot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the power of Excalibur, defend your kingdom, and defeat villainous foes who threaten your land.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to strategize your way to victory?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/dd4d6ce30221f885e1d91f6c8af98add.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/dd4d6ce30221f885e1d91f6c8af98add.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/dd4d6ce30221f885e1d91f6c8af98add.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 An immersive story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark pact is made for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What price will be paid for wielding the power of Excalibur?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will the kingdom of Camelot prevail? Only you can discover the answers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/f5f03d260bfb5dbfeb2816e3a6254ee1.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/f5f03d260bfb5dbfeb2816e3a6254ee1.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/f5f03d260bfb5dbfeb2816e3a6254ee1.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Intense battles against legendary enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect heroes from the legend of King Arthur and take on powerful enemies. Obtain powerful elemental weapons, swap them out as needed, and perfect your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/64ab3b20ddd448936fa22da4218ae56b.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/64ab3b20ddd448936fa22da4218ae56b.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/64ab3b20ddd448936fa22da4218ae56b.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Turn-based strategic battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on player-driven cohesive combat and hero designs to back it up, King Arthur: Legends Rise represents the next evolution of the turn-based strategy genre. Stay tuned for story updates, new game modes, and even more content coming up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/4633f4ffa9135fbbfb6f7d7baac56d89.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/4633f4ffa9135fbbfb6f7d7baac56d89.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/4633f4ffa9135fbbfb6f7d7baac56d89.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6\u00a0Co-op Play with Clan Friends </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge periodic Clan Wars, work together with your members to destroy the enemy's Footholds and conquer their Field! You can attack a single Foothold simultaneously with up to 3 friends. Compare everyone's carefully built teams, analyze their individual strengths, and combine them to create the best strategy to take down the enemy's Field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/fb245c6790775a7fdc9712a6dd9c5894.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/fb245c6790775a7fdc9712a6dd9c5894.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/fb245c6790775a7fdc9712a6dd9c5894.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/ee4866872c82dc133d7b0b4347ab094a.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/ee4866872c82dc133d7b0b4347ab094a.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/ee4866872c82dc133d7b0b4347ab094a.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the battle for the fate of Europe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fires of war have spread across Camelot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the power of Excalibur, defend your kingdom, and defeat villainous foes who threaten your land.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to strategize your way to victory?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/dd4d6ce30221f885e1d91f6c8af98add.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/dd4d6ce30221f885e1d91f6c8af98add.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/dd4d6ce30221f885e1d91f6c8af98add.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 An immersive story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark pact is made for victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > What price will be paid for wielding the power of Excalibur?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will the kingdom of Camelot prevail? Only you can discover the answers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/f5f03d260bfb5dbfeb2816e3a6254ee1.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/f5f03d260bfb5dbfeb2816e3a6254ee1.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/f5f03d260bfb5dbfeb2816e3a6254ee1.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Intense battles against legendary enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect heroes from the legend of King Arthur and take on powerful enemies. Obtain powerful elemental weapons, swap them out as needed, and perfect your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/64ab3b20ddd448936fa22da4218ae56b.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/64ab3b20ddd448936fa22da4218ae56b.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/64ab3b20ddd448936fa22da4218ae56b.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Turn-based strategic battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a focus on player-driven cohesive combat and hero designs to back it up, King Arthur: Legends Rise represents the next evolution of the turn-based strategy genre. Stay tuned for story updates, new game modes, and even more content coming up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/4633f4ffa9135fbbfb6f7d7baac56d89.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/4633f4ffa9135fbbfb6f7d7baac56d89.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/4633f4ffa9135fbbfb6f7d7baac56d89.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6\u00a0Co-op Play with Clan Friends </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge periodic Clan Wars, work together with your members to destroy the enemy's Footholds and conquer their Field! You can attack a single Foothold simultaneously with up to 3 friends. Compare everyone's carefully built teams, analyze their individual strengths, and combine them to create the best strategy to take down the enemy's Field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/fb245c6790775a7fdc9712a6dd9c5894.poster.avif?t=1745398879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/fb245c6790775a7fdc9712a6dd9c5894.webm?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2279730/extras/fb245c6790775a7fdc9712a6dd9c5894.mp4?t=1745398879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
